THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

`docs/archive/legacy-openpose/` contains a Keras implementation of CMU OpenPose
that the original capstone vendored. It is MIT licensed and carries its own
copyright — Copyright (c) 2020 Vinay Varma — retained verbatim at
`docs/archive/legacy-openpose/LICENSE`. That code is preserved as audit evidence
only; it is excluded from linting, type checking and packaging, and nothing in
this project imports it.

The 209 MB Keras weights that code depended on were distributed as a bare
Dropbox link with no licence, checksum or stated provenance
(`docs/archive/legacy-openpose/model-weights-readme.md`). They are not
redistributed here, and the inability to establish their provenance is one of
the reasons v2 uses MediaPipe instead — see `docs/adr/0002-mediapipe-pose.md`.
